{"id":193248221396770,"type":"artist","name":"Ozric Tentacles","artist":null,"year":1983,"weight":33,"info":{"tags":["space rock","Progressive rock","Psychedelic Rock","psychedelic","instrumental"],"country":"GB","begin":"1983","kind":"Group","similar":["Hidria Spacefolk","Steve Hillage","Hawkwind","Gong","Eloy","Shpongle","Nektar","Kingston Wall","Porcupine Tree","Øresund Space Collective"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Ozric_Tentacles_live_in_Zagreb_in_2004.jpg?width=500","bio":"Esta original agrupación se forma en 1982, su primer álbum sale en 1989 y para el año 2002, completan ya más de 20 discos. Siendo su principal influencia GONG, los OZRIC TENTACLES (OT) de la mano de su líder, el virtuoso guitarrista Ed WYNNE, se han mantenido como el ejemplo de mayor jerarquía dentro del rock espacial actual.\n\nOT tiene un sonido \"marca propia\" dentro del progresivo fusión, donde mezclan lo cósmico con lo electrónico, imprimiendo en sus discos pasajes rock"},"works":[{"id":174172693890104,"type":"album","name":"Erpsongs","artist":"Ozric Tentacles","year":1985,"weight":3,"yt":"xkIB1WorE88","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":28712889142764,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Jam Band","rank":105,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":92575986548394,"type":"album","name":"Tantric Obstacles","artist":"Ozric Tentacles","year":1985,"weight":3,"yt":"6KviIdlhPuA","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":28712889142764,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Jam Band","rank":120,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":233680042754754,"type":"album","name":"There Is Nothing","artist":"Ozric Tentacles","year":1986,"weight":3,"yt":"zaJ4dVurrQQ","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":28712889142764,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Jam Band","rank":100,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":112888208653077,"type":"album","name":"Sliding Gliding Worlds","artist":"Ozric Tentacles","year":1988,"weight":3,"yt":"Q8N_Yp